@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@jobId = replace-with-a-job-id

### Liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Readiness (includes PostgreSQL)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Submit a job
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jobs
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: example-build-001

{
  "queue": "default",
  "priority": 0,
  "maximumAttempts": 3,
  "payload": {
    "command": "example"
  }
}

### Retrieve a job
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jobs/01a0f0f9-071c-778b-8cfd-91f047677f20
